TH-CS (the record): step = (1 - f/600) [(1 + k_m) D_m + (1 + k_s) D_s] with 0 < D <= P_fix; NoC rail 0; unmetered k_m dP_m + k_s dP_s
   largest 100 MHz board step allowed if the leakage law is exp  : 2.46 W
   largest 100 MHz board step allowed if the leakage law is arr  : 4.14 W
   largest 100 MHz board step allowed if the leakage law is T2arr: 3.95 W
