H. The schedule (plan arithmetic; timings ASSUMED from NV DESIGN.md s6 and nv.json timing_s)
==============================================================================================================
Stage 0 (read-only): 1.4 min of card time
segment (set, read-back, two windows) 26 s; a pass of 9 segments 3.9 min
Stage A: quieting and checks 0.6 min, probe 2.6, 4 passes 18.6, load 1.9, hot 10.3, restore 0.3: 34 min of card time (22 min without the optional load and hot items)
Stage B: first write 0.5 min, minion ladder down and up 5.3, SRAM ladder 2.1, dwell at the lowest point 10, restore 0.4: 18 min of card time
writes: SET_FREQUENCY about 51: each also re-locks the NoC PLL at 400 MHz (stock CLI); SET_MODULE_VOLTAGE 17; SET_MODULE_ACTIVE_POWER_MANAGEMENT 2

